menu "figma2lvgl example"

    config EXAMPLE_TOUCH_PIN_CS
        int "XPT2046 touch chip-select GPIO"
        range 0 48
        default 1 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32C3
        default 25
        help
            GPIO for the XPT2046 touch controller's chip-select. Touch shares
            the display's SPI bus (host, clock, MOSI and MISO from the
            ILI9486 driver settings), so only its chip-select is set here.
            On ESP32-C3 boards avoid GPIO8 (onboard LED and strapping pin),
            GPIO9 (BOOT strapping pin) and GPIO2 (strapping pin).

endmenu
